: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">에 따라 보상이 확정된 것</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이미 채택된 제안이거나 그 기본 구상이 이와 유사한 것</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일반 통념상 적용이 불가능하다고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">판단되는 것</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: -5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">3. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단순한 주의환기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">진정</span><span lang